---
---

<details class="dossier-folder" data-discover="onderneming">
  <summary>
    <span class="folder-tab mono">Case 001</span>
    <span class="folder-title-row">
      <h3>Studio Maud</h3>
      <span class="folder-status mono">Actief</span>
    </span>
    <span class="folder-toggle mono" aria-hidden="true">Map openen</span>
  </summary>

  <div class="folder-contents">
    <div class="folder-col">
      <span class="folder-label mono">Objectief</span>
      <p>Data-gedreven tweedehands e-commerce op Vinted: sourcing, prijszetting, kwaliteitscontrole, verkoop en logistiek, allemaal in eigen beheer.</p>

      <span class="folder-label mono">Rol</span>
      <p>Zelfstandig gerund sinds februari 2025, voortbouwend op handel sinds haar veertiende. Ralph Lauren als hoofdcategorie, met eigen authenticiteits- en kwaliteitscontrole.</p>

      <span class="folder-label mono">Connectie</span>
      <p>Voortzetting van het geblokkeerde account @maud.hendrix. Opvolger van VintieBulk, de B2B-groothandel die eraan voorafging.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="folder-col folder-evidence">
      <span class="folder-label mono">Bewijsstukken</span>
      <ul class="evidence-list">
        <li><span class="evidence-value mono">2.500+</span>transacties sinds de start</li>
        <li><span class="evidence-value mono">774</span>orders in 2025</li>
        <li><span class="evidence-value mono">56%</span>brutomarge</li>
        <li><span class="evidence-value mono">4,81 / 5</span>verkopersbeoordeling</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="folder-link mono" href="https://www.vinted.be/member/306398525-studiomaud" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Bekijk het Vinted-profiel →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>(".dossier-folder").forEach((el) => {
    el.addEventListener("toggle", () => {
      if (el.open) {
        el.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("dossier:discovered", { bubbles: true, detail: "onderneming" }));
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .dossier-folder {
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .dossier-folder summary {
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 24px 26px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .dossier-folder summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .folder-tab {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 5px 12px;
  }
  .folder-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .folder-title-row h3 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .folder-status {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mustard-deep);
  }
  .folder-toggle {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--navy);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .dossier-folder[open] .folder-toggle {
    opacity: 0;
    height: 0;
  }

  .folder-contents {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 4px 26px 30px;
    border-top: 2px dashed var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0;
    padding-top: 22px;
  }
  .folder-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mustard-deep);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .folder-label:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .folder-col p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .evidence-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .evidence-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-block: 10px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .evidence-value {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    min-width: 4.5ch;
  }
  .folder-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--navy);
  }
  .folder-link:hover {
    color: var(--rust);
    border-color: var(--rust);
  }

  .dossier-folder summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--ink);
    outline-offset: -3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .folder-contents {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
